      "k": "para",
      "text": "The Investment Manager is entitled to a management fee of 0.75% per annum of the net asset value of the Fund, accrued at each valuation point and payable monthly in arrears. The Directors of the ICAV throughout the year were M. Ferreira, S. Ojo and D. Kavanagh. Directors' fees of £78,000 (2024: £72,000) were charged in the year, of which none was outstanding at the year end."
